abstract Keyword

It is a keyword which can be used with classes and methods.

concrete class :
a class which is not declared with abstract keyword .

Abstract class :
A class which is declared with abstract keyword.
Abstract class is incomplet class, abstract class can have abstract methods as well concrete methods

concrete method:
a concrete method which is not declared with abstract keyword and which has both declaraction and implementation .
example :  
 void m1()
  {
  -------
  -------
   }

Abstract method: 
An abstract method has only declaration and no implementation .
The implementation for the abstract method should be provided by the sub class after Overriding it.
It must be declared using abstract keyword

syntax : Accessspecifier  abstrcat retrunType methodName();



NOTE: 
A class inherits or extend an abstract class
We cannot create an object of abstract class
Abstract method : cannot be private
